    },
    {
      "text": "Place the cucumber slices on parchment paper then pat dry with a paper towel.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-turkey-and-pesto-cucumber-roll-ups/#wprm-recipe-59964-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/keto-turkey-and-pesto-cucumber-roll-ups-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread about 1 teaspoon of pesto on each cucumber, Then lay down the cheese, turkey, bell pepper, and spinach on each. Season with a little salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-turkey-and-pesto-cucumber-roll-ups/#wprm-recipe-59964-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/keto-turkey-and-pesto-cucumber-roll-ups-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up and place seam down. Use toothpicks to secure if you plan to serve as an appetizer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-turkey-and-pesto-cucumber-roll-ups/#wprm-recipe-59964-step-0-3",
